sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer / CI
    participant CLI as sdat CLI (sdat/cli.py)
    participant Orch as Audit Pipeline (sdat/orchestrator.py)
    participant Scanners as Scanner Registry (sdat/scanners/)
    participant Cache as ContentCache (.sdat_cache/)
    participant Agg as EvidenceAggregator (sdat/evidence/)
    participant Swarm as Swarm Orchestrator (sdat/swarm/)
    participant Merger as Decision Merger (merger.py)
    participant AI as AI Gateway (sdat/ai/)
    participant Render as Jinja2 Renderer (sdat/renderer/)
    participant FS as File System (docs/audit/)

    Dev->>CLI: sdat audit [target]
    CLI->>Orch: run_audit_pipeline(target_root, output_dir)
    Note over Orch: Stage 1: Path Resolution & Secret Exclusion

    Orch->>Scanners: Discover & scan files for registered languages
    loop For each candidate source file
        Scanners->>Cache: Check content hash (SHA-256)
        alt Cache Hit
            Cache-->>Scanners: Reconstitute cached EvidenceFacts
        else Cache Miss
            Scanners->>Scanners: Parse AST & extract structural facts
            Scanners->>Cache: Store facts by content hash
        end
    end
    Scanners-->>Orch: list[EvidenceFact]

    Note over Orch: Stage 3: Evidence Aggregation
    Orch->>Agg: correlate(all_facts)
    Agg-->>Orch: Correlated EvidenceBundles & facts

    Note over Orch: Stage 4: Resilient Swarm Evaluation
    Orch->>Swarm: execute(project_context)
    par Concurrent Agent Execution
        Swarm->>Swarm: Run Foundation Agents (F-01..F-20)
    and
        Swarm->>Swarm: Run Domain & KnowledgePack Agents
    end
    Swarm->>Merger: merge_decisions(raw_agent_outputs)
    Merger-->>Orch: Deduplicated list[Decision]

    Note over Orch: Stage 5: Optional AI Reasoning Pass
    alt --no-ai is NOT set and credentials present
        Orch->>AI: enrich_findings(decisions, facts)
        alt API Success
            AI-->>Orch: AIEnrichmentResult (Executive Summary + Fix Cards)
        else API Failure or Timeout
            AI-->>Orch: Fail-Open to Deterministic Remediation
        end
    else --no-ai active
        Orch->>Orch: Generate deterministic remediation cards
    end

    Note over Orch: Stage 6: Report & Telemetry Generation
    Orch->>Render: render_reports(decisions, enrichment)
    Render->>FS: Write 01-inventory.md
    Render->>FS: Write 02-gaps.md
    Render->>FS: Write 03-misconfigurations.md
    Render->>FS: Write 04-remediation.md
    Orch->>FS: Write telemetry.json
    Orch-->>CLI: AuditResult (counts, paths, metrics)
    CLI-->>Dev: Rich console summary cards (Exit code 0)
